    "annotations": [
      {
        "id": "a1",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Levitation module.** Left: chopper (MSe) driving the coil 1-junction Jc with the coil resistance, a current detector and the coil port of EM, the electromagnet IC-field (L(h) = L_inf + 2 alpha/h, F = alpha i^2/h^2). Right: the bogie 1-junction Jb (chassis mass, weight, EM armature, skid contact and the secondary suspension Sus) and the body junction Jq. Velocities are positive upward. The guideway moves with the flow source Rail on Jr.",
        "x": 40,
        "y": 900,
        "w": 1500,
        "h": 90
      }
    ]
  },
